其在贵守约〖8〗，即敕御府为母作锦被，改易帷帐；妻妾衣服悉皆锦绣","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-10a4147d99521dd7980b","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-09bba882c0c6e26f80f2","layer":"original","quote":"迁荡寇将军，领濡须督","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":106,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-208a940189191ef67264","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-a4d37ac70964e80b0988","layer":"original","quote":"后召还都，拜（津）右护军，典领辞讼","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-30bc891313fd88e2f571","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-59188630395876d5b2b2","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十年，从攻合肥。会疫疾，军旅皆已引出；唯车下虎士千余人〖2〗，并吕蒙、蒋钦、凌统及宁，从权逍遥津北。张辽觇望知之〖3〗，即将步骑奄至。宁引弓射敌，与统等死战。宁厉声问：“鼓吹何以不作〖4〗！”壮气毅然，权尤嘉之","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":247,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-4dcb82116d7d24ae043f","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-03e3c831370ff1d72371","layer":"original","quote":"初，钦屯宣城，尝讨豫章贼。芜湖令徐盛收钦屯吏〖9〗，表斩之；权以钦在远，不许。盛由是自嫌于钦","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-563cfec6e5d2ead3769d","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-09bba882c0c6e26f80f2","layer":"original","quote":"会稽〔东〕冶贼吕合、秦狼等为乱；钦将兵讨击，遂擒合、狼，五县平定","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-597d85d4ed9c6ed57b11","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-de3662f0e4df848abd29","layer":"original","quote":"鄱阳贼彭虎等众数万人，袭与凌统、步骘、蒋钦各别分讨。袭所向辄破，虎等望见旌旗，便散走，旬日尽平。拜威越校尉〖6〗，迁偏将军","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":112,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-60f5d6338f0363a11dc3","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-78e5706a8fa32863900a","layer":"pei","quote":"权谓钦曰：‘盛前白卿，卿今举盛；欲慕祁奚邪？’钦对曰：‘臣闻公举不挟私怨。盛忠而勤强，有胆略器用，好万人督也。今大事未定，臣当助国求才；岂敢挟私恨以蔽贤乎！’权嘉之","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ba745765728e594ae791","start":11,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-6ce0d3f7175f90cc7b37","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2dac80f715e3dc8feb8b","layer":"original","quote":"蒋钦字公奕，九江寿春人也。","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-7f09015d19a4599e5bc0","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-1c84071264809633ecc0","layer":"original","quote":"合肥之役，张辽奄至，诸将不备。陈武斗死，宋谦、徐盛皆披走。璋身次在后，便驰进；横马斩谦、盛兵走者二人，兵皆还战：权甚壮之。拜偏将军，遂领（百）〔五〕校，屯半州","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-9543f330c55bd04a5645","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-3f1edfa533b2104407c1","layer":"original","quote":"权讨关羽，钦督水军入沔。还，道病卒","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-956cb08068ab0604f15b","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-75f9ff64fd58fdbc8556","layer":"original","quote":"与蒋钦随孙策为左右：服事恭敬，数战有功。策入会稽，署别部司马，授兵","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-99c5207c5ced7a9322d4","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-09bba882c0c6e26f80f2","layer":"original","quote":"贺齐讨黟贼，钦督万兵，与齐并力，黟贼平定","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":61,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-b34746db6326552cce8d","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2dac80f715e3dc8feb8b","layer":"original","quote":"与策周旋，平定三郡；又从定豫章。调授葛阳尉〖2〗，历三县长，讨平盗贼","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":48,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-b3c5642d57b0ec212caf","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2dac80f715e3dc8feb8b","layer":"original","quote":"孙策之（袭）〔依〕袁术，钦随从给事〖1〗。及策东渡，拜别部司马，授兵","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-b7158c9028a816ad897a","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-03e3c831370ff1d72371","layer":"original","quote":"曹公出濡须，钦与吕蒙持诸军节度〖10〗；盛常畏钦因事害己，而钦每称其善。盛既服德，论者美焉","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-bbdae7d754c04167e68f","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-09bba882c0c6e26f80f2","layer":"original","quote":"从征合肥，魏将张辽袭权于津北〖6〗，钦力战有功","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":82,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-c9178e4de5e1f4d5f1c0","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-fc775defe345ffb22e72","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十年，从击合肥，奋命战死。权哀之，自临其葬","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-dfa8281d3da2ee994167","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-6c8f6e6155dc4b71961f","layer":"original","quote":"时权撤军，前部已发；魏将张辽等，奄至津北。权使追还前兵，兵去已远，势不相及；统率亲近三百人陷围，扶扞权出。敌已毁桥，桥之属者两版〖15〗，权策马驱驰；统复还战，左右尽死，身亦被创，所杀数十人；度权已免，乃还。桥败路绝，统被甲潜行","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":272,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-ea4b252883052680a933","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2dac80f715e3dc8feb8b","layer":"original","quote":"迁西部都尉","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-70589874176e47a80f82","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-5e810aa332c2516ac50a","layer":"pei","quote":"权征合肥还，为张辽所掩袭于津北：几至危殆。齐时率三千兵，在津南迎权。权既入大船，会诸将饮宴","attribution":"裴注·《江表传》","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-eb3c2cf75ce087f62140","start":11,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-d7f027d12650dcae307a","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-6b25cc3dff11743d90d2","layer":"original","quote":"权以岱为督军校尉，与将军蒋钦等将兵讨之。遂擒合、狼，五县平定","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-fa635cf609ade308bebc","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-13fedaa660ef9dfd713e","layer":"original","quote":"二十年〖13〗，从权征合肥。时城中出战，徐盛被创失（矛）〔牙〕〖14〗。齐引兵拒击，得盛所失","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-05f0fb998bfc8704c14b","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-64eb7ed11151550d0650","layer":"original","quote":"与张辽、乐进屯合肥","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-34c79c216a498f50c9b2","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-64eb7ed11151550d0650","layer":"original","quote":"乃率众与辽破走权","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-b2a7cbf802ececc91f14","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-64eb7ed11151550d0650","layer":"original","quote":"辽欲奉教出战〖12〗；进、典、辽，皆素不睦，辽恐其不从","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-b36ec05beaafe3e95b4a","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-64eb7ed11151550d0650","layer":"original","quote":"孙权率众围之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ef25d47a4d54797ab7f5","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-64eb7ed11151550d0650","layer":"original","quote":"典慨然曰：“此国家大事，顾君计何如耳！吾可以私憾而忘公义乎","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o177a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-56be09918e62007ce730","layer":"original","quote":"八月，孙权围合肥；张辽、李典击破之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o030a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c5544862d0f0dbfb0095","layer":"original","quote":"权返自陆口，遂征合肥。合肥未下，撤军还，兵皆就路。权与凌统、甘宁等在津北，为魏将张辽所袭〖15〗；统等以死捍权，权乘骏马越津桥，得去。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o009a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-7aaac17cec433f853374","layer":"original","quote":"平旦〖9〗，辽被甲持戟，先登陷阵；杀数十人，斩二将；大呼自名〖10〗，冲垒入，至权麾下。权大惊，众不知所为；走登高冢，以长戟自守。辽叱权“下战”，权不敢动；望见辽所将众少，乃聚围辽数重。辽左右麾围〖11〗，直前急击；围开，辽将麾下数十人得出。余众号呼曰：“将军弃我乎！”辽复还，突围，拔出余众。权人马皆披靡，无敢当者。自旦战至日中，吴人夺气〖12〗。还修守备，众心乃安，诸将咸服。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-7aaac17cec433f853374","layer":"original","quote":"权守合肥十余日〖13〗，城不可拔，乃引退。辽率诸军追击，几复获权。太祖大壮辽，拜征东将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":190,"end":235,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o085b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-1827f70f66ba5b4938c3","layer":"original","quote":"师还，遂征合肥。既撤兵，为张辽等所袭，蒙与凌统，以死扞卫。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-p021a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3a711981ab0547842a9a","layer":"pei","quote":"初，权谓蒙及蒋钦曰：‘卿今并当途掌事，宜学问以自开益。’蒙曰：‘在军中，常苦多务，恐不容复读书。’权曰：‘孤岂欲卿治经为博士邪？但当令涉猎见往事耳！卿言多务，孰若孤？孤少时历《诗》、《书》、《礼记》、《左传》、《国语》，惟不读《易》。至统事以来，省三史、诸家兵书，自以为大有所益。如卿二人，意性朗悟；学必得之，宁当不为乎！宜急读《孙子》、《六韬》、《左传》、《国语》及三史。孔子言：“终日不食，终夜不寝以思，无益；不如学也。”光武当兵马之务，手不释卷。孟德亦自谓“老而好学”。卿何独不自勉勖邪？’蒙始就学，笃志不倦；其所览见，旧儒不胜。","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5c8f4d175003c76305bc","start":11,"end":279,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o087","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-99f1410e6ac0cd0d23ea","layer":"original","quote":"初，鲁肃等以为：“曹公尚存，祸难始构，宜相辅协〖1〗，与之同仇〖2〗，不可失也〖3〗。”蒙乃密陈计策曰：“今征虏守南郡〖4〗；潘璋住白帝〖5〗；蒋钦将游兵万人〖6〗，循江上下，应敌所在；蒙为国家前据襄阳。如此，何忧于操？何赖于羽？且羽君臣，矜其诈力；所在反覆〖7〗，不可以腹心待也。今羽所以未便东向者，以至尊圣明，蒙等尚存也。今不于强壮时图之，一旦僵仆〖8〗，欲复陈力〖9〗，其可得邪？”权深纳其策。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":200,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p021","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3a711981ab0547842a9a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《江表传》曰：“初，权谓蒙及蒋钦曰：‘卿今并当途掌事，宜学问以自开益。’蒙曰：‘在军中，常苦多务，恐不容复读书。’权曰：‘孤岂欲卿治经为博士邪？但当令涉猎见往事耳！卿言多务，孰若孤？孤少时历《诗》、《书》、《礼记》、《左传》、《国语》，惟不读《易》。至统事以来，省三史、诸家兵书，自以为大有所益。如卿二人，意性朗悟；学必得之，宁当不为乎！宜急读《孙子》、《六韬》、《左传》、《国语》及三史。孔子言：“终日不食，终夜不寝以思，无益；不如学也。”光武当兵马之务，手不释卷。孟德亦自谓“老而好学”。卿何独不自勉勖邪？’蒙始就学，笃志不倦；其所览见，旧儒不胜。后鲁肃上代周瑜，过蒙言议，常欲受屈。肃拊蒙背曰：‘吾谓大弟但有武略耳。至于今者，学识英博：非复吴下阿蒙！’蒙曰：‘士别三日，即更刮目相待。大兄今论，何一称穰侯乎？兄今代公瑾，既难为继；且与关羽为邻，斯人长而好学，读《左传》略皆上口，梗亮有雄气；然性颇自负，好陵人。今与为对，当有单复以（卿）〔向〕待之。’密为肃陈三策，肃敬受之，秘而不宣。权常叹曰：‘人长而进益，如吕蒙、蒋钦，盖不可及也。富贵荣显，更能折节好学；耽悦书传，轻财尚义；所行可迹，并作国士：不亦休乎！’”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5c8f4d175003c76305bc","start":0,"end":512,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"zhouyu-p0049":{"fields":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0049-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"公奕","evidence":["chenghuang-q-6ce0d3f7175f90cc7b37"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
